{"strongs": "H6697", "word": "צוּר", "translit": "tsur", "root": "צור", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "rock, cliff", "definition": "I. צוּר noun masculine Job 29:6 rock, cliff ; — ׳ צ absolute Exod 17:6 +, construct Deut 8:15 +; suffix צוּרִי 2Sam 22:3 , etc.; plural צֻרִים Num 23:9 +, צוּרוֺת Job 28:10 construct צוּרֵי 1Sam 24:3 ( Gi v. 1Sam 24:2 ); — 1. a. rocky wall, cliff , Exod 17:6 (twice in verse) ( E ), Deut 8:15 ( הַחַלָּמִישׁ ׳ צ ), Isa 48:21 (twice in verse); Ps 78:15 ; Ps 78:20 ; Ps 105:41 ; Ps 114:8 (|| חַלָּמִישׁ ); ׳ בּוֺא בַצּ Isa 2:10 , בִּמְעָרוֺת צֻרִים v Isa 2:19 , ׳ בְּנִקְרוֺת הַצּ v Isa 2:21 , compare Exod 33:21 ; Exod 33:22 ( J E ); yielding honey (from its clefts) Ps 81:17 (compare Deut 32:13 Dy Perles Anal. 34 We read צוּף ); as look-out Num 23:9 ( J E ), home of goats 1Sam 24:3 ( Gi v. 1Sam 24:2 ), snow-covered Jer 18:14 bearing (olives for) oil Deut 32:13 ( ׳ חַלְמִישׁ צ ), Job 29:6 resort of homeless Job 24:8 , pierced by miners Job 28:10 , compare perhaps נְחָלִים ׳ שִׁית בְּצ אוֺפִיר Job 22:24 deposit (thy) gold in the rock of the wadys (most below צֹר pebble); as quarry, figurative of Abraham as ancestor of Israel Isa 51:1 place of security 1Chr 11:15 , הַמִּישׁוֺר ׳ צ Jer 21:13 (of city), figurative Ps 27:5 ; Ps 61:3 symbol of firmness Nah 1:6 ; Job 14:18 ; Job 18:4 enduring material Job 19:24 . \\ \\ b. rock with flat surface 2Sam 21:10 ; Prov 30:19 . \\ \\ c. block of stone, boulder Judg 6:21 ; Judg 13:19 (as altar); compare צוּר מִכְשׁוֺל Isa 8:14 (|| נֶגֶף אֶבֶן ). \\ \\ d. rock with specific name, עוֺרֵב ׳ צ Judg 7:25 ; Isa 10:26 . 2. a. figurative of God (33 t.) as support and defence of his people (often || אֱלֹהִים , ׳ י , etc.), מָעֻזֵּךְ ׳ צ Isa 17:10 , מָעוֺז ׳ צ Ps 31:3 , עֻזִּי ׳ צ Ps 62:8 , מָעוֺן ׳ צ , Ps 71:3 , יְשֻׁעָתוֺ ׳ צ Deut 32:15 compare 2Sam 22:47 b (but strike out, see || Ps 18:47 ), Ps 89:27 ; Ps 95:1 , וִישׁוּעָתִי ׳ צ Ps 62:3 ; Ps 62:7 , מַחְסִי ׳ צ Ps 94:22 יִשְׂרָאֵל ׳ צ Isa 30:29 ; 2Sam 23:3 (personified), צוּרִי Ps 18:3 ; Ps 18:47 = 2Sam 22:3 ; 2Sam 22:47 a, >BIBLE:Psalm 19:15>; Ps 28:1 ; Ps 92:16 ; Ps 144:1 , לְבָבִי ׳ צ Ps 73:26 , צוּרֵנוּ Deut 32:31 , צוּרָם v Deut 32:30 ; Ps 78:35 with בְּ essent. ׳ בְּיָהּ י עוֺלָמִים ׳ צ Isa 26:4 (compare Ps 62:8 see ב I. 7 c ); as proper name, of deity ( the Rock Deut 32:4 ; Deut 32:18 ( יְלָֽדְךָ ׳ צ ), v Deut 32:37 ; Hab 1:12 , +(perhaps) Ps 75:6 (read בַּצּוּד , see צַוָּאר ; see also פְּדָהצוּר ). \\ \\ b. of a heathen god Deut 32:31 , compare Isa 44:3 , מִי צוּר ׳ מִבַּלְעֲדֵי א 2Sam 22:32 || Ps 18:32 , compare 1Sam 2:2 . — See also בֵּית צוּר and חֶלְקַת הַצֻּרִים . — Ps 89:44 see צֹד below III. צרר , Ps 49:15 see צוּרָה below III. צור . above", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7020')\">BDB7020</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6697')\">H6697</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7019')\">BDB7019</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7021')\">BDB7021</entry></div><p> I. <bdbheb>צוּר</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Job 29:6\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(18,29,6)\">Job 29:6</ref></sup> <highlightword>rock, cliff</highlightword>; — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>צ</bdbheb> absolute <ref ref=\"Exod 17:6\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(2,17,6)\">Exod 17:6</ref> +, construct <ref ref=\"Deut 8:15\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(5,8,15)\">Deut 8:15</ref> +; suffix <bdbheb>צוּרִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 22:3\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(10,22,3)\">2Sam 22:3</ref>, etc.; plural <bdbheb>צֻרִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 23:9\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(4,23,9)\">Num 23:9</ref> +, <bdbheb>צוּרוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 28:10\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(18,28,10)\">Job 28:10</